    "detailed_description": "<h1>ALSO RECOMMENDED FOR YOU</h1><p><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582950/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1701979171\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582950/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1701979171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582950/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1701979171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Test your deduction skills and your cinema knowledge</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582950/extras/e02994c3ce587ea58233a42971f86b42.avif?t=1701979171\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock new levels with hits</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582950/extras/6790514df9ac8d214afb7ad9794689e1.avif?t=1701979171\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Each level has a category</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582950/extras/6cc7f518eb9d656ea5949ac1c45ec523.poster.avif?t=1701979171\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582950/extras/6cc7f518eb9d656ea5949ac1c45ec523.webm?t=1701979171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582950/extras/6cc7f518eb9d656ea5949ac1c45ec523.mp4?t=1701979171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Some filmemojis are hard to guess</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582950/extras/7a7d5d1e8ad34bc9c7635a3b98bd7fa4.avif?t=1701979171\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 200 handcrafted filmemojis to guess.<br></li><li> 40 levels with 5 filmemoji.<br></li><li> Each level belongs to one of the following categories: classic, horror, action, comedy, thriller, romance, drama, adventure, science fiction, animation, western, fantasy, biography, musical, cult, miscellaneous and hard.<br></li><li> It's pretty hard to guess alone all filmemojis.<br></li><li> Has hidden achievments...</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Test your deduction skills and your cinema knowledge</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582950/extras/e02994c3ce587ea58233a42971f86b42.avif?t=1701979171\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock new levels with hits</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582950/extras/6790514df9ac8d214afb7ad9794689e1.avif?t=1701979171\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Each level has a category</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582950/extras/6cc7f518eb9d656ea5949ac1c45ec523.poster.avif?t=1701979171\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582950/extras/6cc7f518eb9d656ea5949ac1c45ec523.webm?t=1701979171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582950/extras/6cc7f518eb9d656ea5949ac1c45ec523.mp4?t=1701979171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Some filmemojis are hard to guess</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582950/extras/7a7d5d1e8ad34bc9c7635a3b98bd7fa4.avif?t=1701979171\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 200 handcrafted filmemojis to guess.<br></li><li> 40 levels with 5 filmemoji.<br></li><li> Each level belongs to one of the following categories: classic, horror, action, comedy, thriller, romance, drama, adventure, science fiction, animation, western, fantasy, biography, musical, cult, miscellaneous and hard.<br></li><li> It's pretty hard to guess alone all filmemojis.<br></li><li> Has hidden achievments...</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Do you watch many movies? Test your deduction skills and your cinema knowledge trying to guess the name of the film represented by the emojis. Don't be shy to ask for help, you probably won't discover all the answers by yourself!",
